#. module: art_craft
#: model:product.template,description_sale:art_craft.product_template_23
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Acrylic Kit:\n"
"            1) Heavy Cartridge Mix Media 300 gsm paper pack of 20 A5\n"
"            2) Heavy Cartridge Mix Media 300 gsm paper pack of 20 A4\n"
"            3) Stationerie Artists’ Canvas Board 8”x10”\n"
"            4) Stationerie Artists’ Canvas Board 10”x12”\n"
"            5) Stationerie Homemade Gloss Varnish 90ml\n"
"            6) Stationerie Medium Wooden Palette (14.5×7.5)\n"
"            7) Stationerie Professional Handmade Flat Set Of 8 Hog White\n"
"            (0 1 2 4 6 8 10 12)\n"
"            8) Stationerie 2” Hog White Wash Inch Brush\n"
"            9) Stationerie Palette Knife (Sizes May Differ)\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Акрилен комплект:\n"
"1) Хартия Heavy Cartridge Mix Media 300 gsm опаковка от 20 A5\n"
"2) Хартия Heavy Cartridge Mix Media 300 gsm опаковка от 20 A4\n"
"3) Платно за  художници Stationerie 8”x10”\n"
"4) Платно за художници Stationerie 10\"x12\"\n"
"5) Лак Stationerie Homemade Gloss Varnish 90мл\n"
"6) Средна дървена палитра Stationerie (14.5×7.5)\n"
"7) Професионален ръчно изработен плосък комплект Stationerie от 8 четки със "
"свинска четина\n"
" (0, 1, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12)\n"
"8) Четка Stationerie Hog White Wash Inch Brush 2”\n"
"9) Палетен нож Stationerie (размерите може да варират)\n"
"        "

